Real coefficients for the element routines in this addon.
---------------------------------------------------------

1   E: Young's modulus.

2   mu_stab: parameter for the stabilized elements

3   nu: Poisson's ratio.
    NOTE: if coefficient%i(4)=1, the Poisson's ratio is set to 0.5 and 
    this coefficient is not used.

4   constant change in temperature DT

5   linear coefficient of thermal expansion (alpha)

6-22 reserved for future use 
           
23  Pressure level subtracted from the pressure field solution for determining
    the L2-norm of the error. Used in linear_elastic_L2_error_norm.

24  Normal traction value 

25-50 reserved for future use
